{"title": "Martial Adept", "pageid": 4942, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Martial_Adept", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Martial_Adept.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Martial_Adept.webp/300px-Martial_Adept.webp, /w/images/b/b0/Martial_Adept.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Martial_Adept.webp/300px-Martial_Adept.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Martial_Adept.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Martial Adept</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a> of the same name. You learn two manoeuvres and gain a <a href=\"/wiki/Superiority_Die\" title=\"Superiority Die\">Superiority Die</a> to use them.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Learn two manoeuvres from the <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a> Fighter subclass and receive 1 (additional) <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/20px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/30px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/40px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/20px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superiority_Die\" title=\"Superiority Die\">Superiority Die</a> to fuel them. You regain expended Superiority Dice after a <a href=\"/wiki/Short_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Short Rest\">Short</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Adept_(Feat)\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Martial Adept (Feat)\">Martial Adept (Feat)</a>\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201123\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.026 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 482/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2112/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1431/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 823675/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.254      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   26.254      1 -total\n 31.17%    8.182      1 Template:R\n 16.46%    4.321      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.35%    4.031      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.60%    3.570      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 12.25%    3.217      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n  7.25%    1.903      3 Template:IfEmpty\n  6.05%    1.588      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n  3.21%    0.842      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4942-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714